    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A gigantic tiger of legend that rules the Anghel Waterfall. Originally, it was a sacred and divine creature who guided angels in the heavens, but it mauled its master and ran away to the earth. It despairs of its now miserable life, and has grown violent. It devours any traveler or reckless adventurers who passes by. Animals Lv. 4 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Animals. P. Crit. Rate +25 Speed +5 P. Def. -5% Resistance to Bleed -15% Resistance to Speed Down +20% Resistance to Bow -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
